WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.310
I'm the first rover ever to drive on another planet.

2
00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:11.140
I'm about the size of a microwave oven.

3
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:16.270
I visited rocks the scientists named Barnacle Bill and Yogi.

4
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:23.460
I could only talk to Earth through the lander, so when the lander went quiet, so did I.

5
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.960
The first wheels on another planet.
